                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Phones in my office have been ringing off the hook.\n\n-Mothers wonder if they will be able to feed their children.\n-Cancer patients ask if their chemotherapy will be paid for.\n-Families are scared they won\u2019t be able to pay rent.\n\nThis is the reality of the Trump funding freeze.",
