                "text": "The Republican budget plan is devastating. In #MI13 alone, it: \n\n1. Cuts healthcare for 333,000\n2. Slashes food assistance for 225,000\n3. Doubles Medicare premiums for seniors \n\nAll to pay for more tax cuts for president Musk and his billionaire buddies.",
