                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Medicaid protects lives\u2014and in MI-13, 333,421 people are in danger of losing coverage because of Trump, DOGE, and Republicans in Congress.\n\nI won\u2019t stop fighting to protect our community\u2019s health and make care more affordable for all.",
