                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Before I came to Congress, I brought life-saving health products to market.\n\nToday, Trump and RFK Jr are making dangerous cuts to vaccine research.\n\nThis National Immunization Awareness Month, I\u2019m working to protect coverage for vaccines and reverse the harm they've done.",
